@@ -0,0 +1,40 @@
+Feature: Todo editing
+  As a user
+  I want to edit a todo title
+  So that I can correct or update my task descriptions
+
+  Background:
+    Given I type "Buy milk" into the new-todo input and press Enter
+    And I double-click the label of the todo
+
+  Rule: Save on blur
+
+  Scenario: Save the edit when the input loses focus
+    Given the edit input shows "Buy milk"
+    When I clear the edit input and type "Buy organic milk"
+    And the edit input loses focus
+    Then the todo label shows "Buy organic milk"
+    And the "editing" class is removed from the todo item
+
+  Rule: Save on Enter
+
+  Scenario: Save the edit when Enter is pressed
+    Given the edit input shows "Buy milk"
+    When I clear the edit input and type "Buy organic milk" and press Enter in the edit input
+    Then the todo label shows "Buy organic milk"
+    And the "editing" class is removed from the todo item
+
+  Rule: Destroy on empty
+
+  Scenario: Destroy the todo when the edited title is empty
+    Given the edit input shows "Buy milk"
+    When I clear the edit input and press Enter in the edit input
+    Then the todo is removed from the list
+
+  Rule: Cancel on Escape
+
+  Scenario: Cancel editing and discard changes on Escape
+    Given the edit input shows "Buy milk"
+    When I clear the edit input and type "Buy organic milk" and press Escape
+    Then the todo label shows "Buy milk"
+    And the "editing" class is removed from the todo item
