+++ b/features/todos.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,109 @@
+Feature: Todo management
+  As a user
+  I want to manage a todo list
+  So that I can track tasks I need to complete
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+
+  Rule: New todo creation
+
+  Scenario: Create a new todo
+    Given the input field shows "What needs to be done?"
+    When I type "Buy milk" into the new-todo input and press Enter
+    Then the todo list shows an item with the text "Buy milk"
+    And the input field is cleared
+
+  Scenario: Do not create an empty todo
+    When I type "   " into the new-todo input and press Enter
+    Then no new item is added to the list
+
+  Rule: No todos state
+
+  Scenario: Hide main and footer when there are no todos
+    Given there are no todos
+    Then the section with class "main" is not visible
+    And the footer is not visible
+
+  Scenario: Show main and footer when a todo exists
+    Given I type "Buy milk" into the new-todo input and press Enter
+    Then the section with class "main" is visible
+    And the footer is visible
+
+  Rule: Completing a todo
+
+  Scenario: Toggle a todo as completed
+    Given I type "Buy milk" into the new-todo input and press Enter
+    When I click the toggle checkbox on the todo
+    Then the todo item receives the class "completed"
+    And its toggle checkbox becomes checked
+
+  Rule: Deleting a todo
+
+  Scenario: Delete a todo
+    Given I type "Buy milk" into the new-todo input and press Enter
+    When I click the destroy button on the todo
+    Then the todo is removed from the list
+
+  Rule: Mark all as complete
+
+  Scenario: Mark all todos as completed
+    Given I create the following todos:
+      | Buy milk    |
+      | Walk the dog |
+    When I click the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then all todos have the class "completed"
+    And the toggle-all checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: Toggle-all reflects individual completion
+    Given I create the following todos:
+      | Buy milk    |
+      | Walk the dog |
+    When I click the toggle checkbox on "Buy milk"
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is not checked
+    When I click the toggle checkbox on "Walk the dog"
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: Toggle-all checkbox clears after clear-completed
+    Given I create the following todos:
+      | Buy milk    |
+      | Walk the dog |
+    When I click the toggle-all checkbox
+    And I click the clear-completed button
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is not checked
+
+  Rule: Counter
+
+  Scenario: Display the number of active todos
+    Given I create the following todos:
+      | Buy milk    |
+      | Walk the dog |
+      | Write code  |
+    When I click the toggle checkbox on "Walk the dog"
+    Then the todo-count shows "<strong>2</strong> items left"
+    When I click the toggle checkbox on "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo-count shows "<strong>1</strong> item left"
+
+  Rule: Clear completed
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed removes all completed todos
+    Given I create the following todos:
+      | Buy milk    |
+      | Walk the dog |
+    When I click the toggle checkbox on "Buy milk"
+    And I click the clear-completed button
+    Then the todo list shows only "Walk the dog"
+    And the clear-completed button is hidden
+
+  Scenario: Hide clear-completed when no todos are completed
+    Given I create the following todos:
+      | Buy milk    |
+    Then the clear-completed button is hidden
+
+  Rule: Item display
+
+  Scenario: Double-clicking a label enters editing mode
+    Given I type "Buy milk" into the new-todo input and press Enter
+    When I double-click the label of the todo
+    Then the todo item receives the class "editing"
+    And the edit input is focused
